{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q410005","formula":"C₁₈H₃₂O₁₆","hill":"C18H32O16","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":32.0,"O":16.0},"names":{"en":"Raffinose","ru":"Рафиноза"},"descriptions":{"en":"Raffinose is a trisaccharide derived from galactose, glucose, and fructose. Raffinose can be hydrolyzed to D-galactose and sucrose by the enzyme alpha galactosidase (α-GAL), an enzyme synthesized by bacteria found in the large intestine. α-GAL also hydrolyzes other alpha galactosides such as stachyose, verbascose, and galactinol, if present.","ru":"Рафиноза (раффиноза) — невосстанавливающий трисахарид, состоящий из остатков D-галактозы, D-глюкозы и D-фруктозы. Бесцветное растворимое в воде вещество с температурой плавления 80 °C (пентагидрат) и 119—120 °C (безводная). Один из распространённых растительных резервных углеводов (сахарная свёкла, семена хлопчатника и др.)."},"fame":35,"pubchemCid":439242,"mass":504.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C([C@@H]1[C@@H]([C@@H]([C@H]([C@H](O1)OC[C@@H]2[C@H]([C@@H]([C@H]([C@H](O2)O[C@]3([C@H]([C@@H]([C@H](O3)CO)O)O)CO)O)O)O)O)O)O)O","inchikey":"MUPFEKGTMRGPLJ-ZQSKZDJDSA-N","iupac":"(2S,3R,4S,5R,6R)-2-[[(2R,3S,4S,5R,6R)-6-[(2S,3S,4S,5R)-3,4-dihydroxy-2,5-bis(hydroxymethyl)oxolan-2-yl]oxy-3,4,5-trihydroxyoxan-2-yl]methoxy]-6-(hydroxymethyl)oxane-3,4,5-triol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"439242","atoms":66,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.858,"y":-1.1,"z":0.007,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.063,"y":1.221,"z":-0.414,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.719,"y":-0.199,"z":-0.479,"el":"O"},{"x":1.929,"y":0.461,"z":0.016,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.838,"y":0.045,"z":2.25,"el":"O"},{"x":-6.196,"y":1.852,"z":0.238,"el":"O"},{"x":3.917,"y":0.903,"z":1.221,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.312,"y":-3.297,"z":-1.652,"el":"O"},{"x":0.217,"y":-4.22,"z":-0.59,"el":"O"},{"x":1.114